    "about_description": "Transcribe transcribes and translates video and audio files into a wide range of languages.\n\nIt is a portable, offline application that can run from a USB drive.\n\nIt can serve as a transcribing voice recorder and is handy for adding subtitles to videos in the language of your choice.\n\nWhen the source language is not English, using the Large model gives better transcription results.\n\nTranslation from English is available in many languages.\n\nIt can extract audio from video files and improve sound quality: noise reduction, loudness normalisation, voice-only filtering.\n\nTranscribe bundles ffmpeg, whisper.cpp and argos-translate.",
